  "description": "I dared to fall in love with him.\nA lone house perched on the cliff of a miserable little island, and the man who was dethroned and exiled there. I watched him on behalf of my sickly father... and I dared to fall in love with him. Without even knowing what my fate entailed.\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: The Revised Version is completed with 74 chapters while the Mature Version is completed with 77 chapters. Chapter count includes 18 side story chapters.*",
